Work through the Prompt Construction Worksheet (see "Prompt Construction Worksheet – Willowmere Bike Repairs") on your own. The worksheet gives you a fictional scenario and guides you step by step to draft a prompt for an AI tool.

The scenario is entirely fictional: Willowmere Bike Repairs (fictional) needs to tell its customer Ashby Florists (fictional) that order ORD-305 (fictional) — two cargo-bike tyres — which was agreed for 17 June (fictional), will now arrive on 24 June (fictional).

Follow the guided steps on the worksheet to:
— write a clear task statement telling the AI what to produce;
— include the relevant fictional details the AI would need;
— choose how to confirm that all details in your prompt are fictional;
— run through the short self-check list at the end.

Write your prompt in the drafting frame provided on the worksheet. No AI tool is run and no generated output is required. This is a writing exercise only.
